  "body": "Hello,\r\nI have a question regarding `filters`, as explained in [filtering](http://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.2.0.html#filtering).\r\n\r\nLet's imagine the following scenario:\r\nMy client has joined many rooms, but chose to filter out only one of them.\r\nAfter a period of time, he changed his filter to include all rooms.\r\nWill he now get the events he missed (from other rooms) while the first filter was active? are those events gone?\r\nI want to use this feature but the spec is not clear enough in my taste, and time doesn't allow me to implement only to find out the actual behavior :).\r\n\r\nThanks for the help.",
